    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math practical and engaging, especially through physics. My vocational diploma in engineering taught me to see it as a tool for problem-solving, not just abstract theory. I enjoy applying it to real-world scenarios like calculating forces in rock climbing or optimizing cooking recipes.",
